docs {
  ### Create Gig
  Creates a new gig. Seller information is populated from the authenticated user token.
  
  #### Headers
  - `Authorization: Bearer <token>` (Inherited)
  
  #### Response (201 Created)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid-string",
      "seller": "uuid-string",
      "category": "90e290f9-a682-4fdb-bb8e-1d638706d860",
      "title": "Build responsive NestJS and React applications",
      "slug": "build-responsive-nestjs-and-react-applications-20260624003000",
      "description": "High-quality, production-ready NestJS and React software engineering.",
      "images": [...],
      "tags": [...],
      "status": "draft",
      "packages": [...],
      "faq": [...],
      "created_at": "2026-06-24T00:30:00.000Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-24T00:30:00.000Z"
    },
    "message": "Gig created successfully"
  }
  ```
}
